{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43299","headline":"太清宫闻滴漏 · 严巨川","name":"太清宫闻滴漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉漏移中禁，齐车入太清。\n渐知催辨色，复听续余声。\n乍逐微风转，时因杂佩轻。\n青楼人罢梦，紫陌骑将行。\n残魄栖初尽，余寒滴更生。\n惭非朝谒客，空有振衣情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严巨川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}